        "ratings": [
            {
                "comment": "Profe Schmiege is an absolute gem. He helps students learn language in a &quot;non-busy work&quot; way. His energy is inspiring at 8am and he keeps the class engaged. The feedback he gives on writing work is super constructive and he wants every student to succeed. He even knew everyone's name on the first day of class without meeting us. TAKE HIS CLASS!",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
